ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/949230/extras/e39677a8bb7fb4718fa8400b54410f6d.mp4?t=1794506466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/949230/extras/dc331aa1a686a8268df4f773b13a4fdb.webp?t=1794506466\" width=780 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your map, pick your climate. While you build, nature does its thing. Day turns to night, seasons change, and weather rolls through. But it’s not decoration. It’ll impact what you build and how.</p>", "short_description": "Raise a city from the ground up and transform it into a thriving metropolis. Push your creativity and problem-solving with deep simulation and a living economy: there’s a map waiting for you in Cities: Skylines II. If you can dream it, you can build it.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/949230/de14fd18639aed1dd558f7ebb08eb28d6febccb3/header_alt_assets_9.jpg?t=1794506466", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/949230/bc52c9675c4040275ff02d81af02f1615044bd74/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_9.jpg?t=1794506466", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/949230/bc52c9675c4040275ff02d81af02f1615044bd74/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_9.jpg?t=1794506466", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 Home 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-6700K | AMD® Ryzen™ 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia® GeForce™ G